  "out of 10: in a university class, the team with the lowest collegiality (0.40) got the lowest mark and the one with the highest (0.63) got the highest. Across teams, higher collegiality went with higher marks.":
    "dari 10: di sebuah kelas kampus, tim dengan collegiality terendah (0.40) mendapat nilai paling rendah, sedangkan skor tertinggi (0.63) mendapat nilai terbaik. Makin tinggi collegiality, makin tinggi pula nilai antartim.",
