  "Use case diagram": "Use case diagram",
  "Activity diagram": "Activity diagram",
  "The use case diagram mapped what lecturers and students each do in the platform: lecturers create classes, tasks and questionnaires, then form, review, edit and export groups; students answer the questionnaire and see their results. Activity diagrams then traced each flow from input to team formation output.":
    "Use case diagram memetakan action kedua role: dosen membuat kelas, task, dan questionnaire; lalu grouping, review, edit, hingga export hasil. Mahasiswa mengisi questionnaire dan melihat hasil tim. Activity diagram mengurai tiap workflow dari tahap input sampai output pembentukan kelompok.",
  "Information architecture": "Information architecture",
  "With the requirements in place, I explored structure before visual detail: information hierarchy, what each screen is for, and workflow clarity across the platform.":
    "Setelah requirements jelas, saya mulai dari struktur sebelum masuk visual: information hierarchy, peran tiap screen, dan kejelasan workflow di seluruh product.",
  "Once the structure was stable, I built a system so complex workflows feel lighter, easier to scan and more approachable for both lecturers and students, and a mascot cast that makes personality data feel human.":
    "Setelah strukturnya solid, saya membangun design system yang bikin complex workflow terasa ringan, scannable, dan approachable bagi dosen maupun mahasiswa. Saya juga merancang cast mascot agar data personality terasa lebih human.",
  Typeface: "Typeface",
  Color: "Color",
  "Gray for structure, indigo as the brand, lime for success. Every swatch is labelled with its WCAG contrast.": "Gray untuk struktur, indigo buat brand, lime buat success state. Semua swatch punya WCAG contrast label.",
  Illustration: "Illustration",
  "Sixteen mascots, one for each MBTI type, grouped into four temperament colours, plus avatars for roles and gender and a five-step face scale for agreement and skill level.":
    "Ada 16 mascot untuk 16 tipe MBTI, dibagi dalam empat warna temperament. Ditambah avatar untuk role dan gender, serta face scale lima level untuk agreement dan skill proficiency.",
  "The product structure and visual system came together in a high-fidelity prototype for both roles, turning workflows, system logic and interface patterns into a complete product experience before validation.":
    "Product structure dan visual system disatukan dalam high-fidelity prototype untuk kedua role. Hasilnya: workflow, system logic, dan UI pattern jadi satu end-to-end experience sebelum masuk tahap validation.",
  "The 19 functional requirements group into eight features, plus one flow added in the final design for classes that aren't complete. They follow a real semester, from setting up a class to understanding why a team is balanced. Each one lists the requirement codes it covers and the design decision behind it.":
    "Dari 19 functional requirements, saya breakdown menjadi delapan fitur utama, plus satu flow tambahan untuk kelas yang belum lengkap pada final design. Alurnya mengikuti perjalanan satu semester, mulai dari class setup sampai penjelasan kenapa sebuah tim dianggap balance. Tiap fitur menampilkan requirement code dan design rationale-nya.",
  "Feature map": "Feature map",
  "Tap a feature to jump to it": "Tap fitur untuk langsung explore",
