  "Hover any bar for exact numbers (added after testing round 2)": "Hover bar untuk angka pasti (ditambahkan seusai testing round 2)",
  "\"Equity had to be visible.\" These charts were added after round 1, when testers could form teams but couldn't explain why they were balanced.":
    "\"Fairness harus terlihat.\" Chart ini muncul setelah testing round 1: user bisa membentuk tim, tapi belum bisa menjelaskan alasan komposisinya balance.",
